{"ID":"20230927161459-zgs6uih","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230927161459-zgs6uih","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161459-zgs6uih\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161502-gmpzbrl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161502-v2l1urh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230927161502-v2l1urh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:124,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:124\u0026#125;","title":"【补坎益离丹】","type":"doc","updated":"20230927161502"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230927161502-gmpzbrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161502-gmpzbrl","updated":"20230927161502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补坎益离丹：对治心肾阳虚诸症，尤以心阳不足为适应症。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161502-h53eeyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161502-h53eeyl","updated":"20230927161502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"组成：附子24g、桂心24g、蛤粉15g、炙甘草12g、生姜5片。"}]},{"ID":"20230927161502-v2l1urh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230927161502-v2l1urh","updated":"20230927161502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郑氏解曰：“补坎益离者，补先天之火，以壮君火也。真火与君火本同一气，真火旺则君火始能旺，真火衰则君火亦既衰。方用附、桂之大辛大热为君，以补坎中之真阳。复取蛤粉之咸以补肾，肾得补而阳有所依，自然合一矣。况又加姜、草调中，最能交通上下”《医法圆通卷一》"}]}]}